programs available to suit your need.\nAvailable in 7 KG, 8 KG and 10 KG variants.\nChoose one for your home now.\n\nConnect with us through:\nWebsite URL: https://himstar.himelectronics.com/\nFacebook Page:   / himelectronics  \nInstagram Page:   / himstarnepal  \n\nHimstar Products are available in EMI (Easy Monthly Installment).\nTo Apply for EMI: https://himelectronics.com/EMI\n\nHimstar products are available in exchange through Arkostore.\nTo exchange visit: https://www.arkostore.com/\n\nFor any queries, contact us @:\nToll-Free No.: 1660-01-88088\nPhone no: 01-5970705\nEmail: info.him@golchhagroup.com.np\n\nHave you had a great experience with Himstar Products? Let us know in the comments below!\n\nAbout Us:\nHim Electronics Pvt. Ltd. is an Electronics \u0026 Electricals company dedicated to delivering quality products in the Nepali market. Learn more about Him Electronics at https://www.himelectronics.com/\n\n#himstar #washingmachine #quick #automatic #household","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":562,"length":35,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwjkvOLBgKSWAxVKJoMDHY6WDCpIydaZrdCrpPdqygEEe-Vs1w==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rU3kzX04tYy14VlBMWTc1bHRlNHA0dXxBR3JiS2FsZTdySzJIM3A5OFNEcm9sOE82WWlLb3RVaFFzQ2tyT0tLVEZuUzQyQk93cExhdklSUnJVbWk4UDJ1My1kRzRmazV1bGdKemdoVFRidlc0NGJweU4xTjA4QUVFQUZL\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fhimstar.himelectronics.com%2F\u0026v=au6RXQWma0k","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rU3kzX04tYy14VlBMWTc1bHRlNHA0dXxBR3JiS2FsZTdySzJIM3A5OFNEcm9sOE82WWlLb3RVaFFzQ2tyT0tLVEZuUzQyQk93cExhdklSUnJVbWk4UDJ1My1kRzRmazV1bGdKemdoVFRidlc0NGJweU4xTjA4QUVFQUZL\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fhimstar.himelectronics.com%2F\u0026v=au6RXQWma0k","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":613,"length":20,"onTap":{"i